{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/TitresSteam_1.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to simply survive as you explore in this Metroidvania game. This game features more than 50 levels each with different themes like forests and rock quarries. Checkpoints are important to save your progress. Enemies and bosses require learning their attack patterns to defeat them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/TitresSteam_1.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/describe.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Game design inspired by 1990s 16-bit classics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Pixel art graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Side-scrolling gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf One player platforming action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/TitresSteam_1.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/controlname.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support. Automatically detects connected controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/TitresSteam_1.png?t=1743546012\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613760/extras/enemy.png?t=17435460